{"diagnosis": "Trace window is sparse/unclear beyond FAIL 0xdead with cpu trap asserted during NOP fetch, so exact rdata values are unclear. Expected stream of NOPs via mem_rdata_latched is instead corrupted because mem_rdata_latched_noshuffle on line 384 selects stale mem_rdata_q when mem_xfer is true and live mem_rdata when false. Root cause is the inverted ternary in the excerpt, swapping latched vs live select.", "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picorv32.v b/picorv32.v
--- a/picorv32.v
+++ b/picorv32.v
@@ -384,1 +384,1 @@
-	assign mem_rdata_latched_noshuffle = (mem_xfer || LATCHED_MEM_RDATA) ? mem_rdata_q : mem_rdata;
+	assign mem_rdata_latched_noshuffle = (mem_xfer || LATCHED_MEM_RDATA) ? mem_rdata : mem_rdata_q;
", "expected": "tohost: PASS (vs FAIL 0xdead), no cpu trap, fetch progresses through NOPs"}

